# Torn picture: IC18's output 1Q_N (SYNC_ARM_N) is stuck high, so IC19 never counts out a horizontal sync pulse: only the vertical pulse remains and the TV cannot lock the lines.
machine bw80
title "Torn picture"
brief "The TV shows the picture torn into slanting streaks that never line up: it cannot lock on the BW-80's picture."
fault stuck IC18.1Q_N 1
